/E (Founded in 1991, the School of Data Science and Forecasting is a pioneering institute in Data Science and Analytics education in India. It offers specialized programs in Data Science, Business Analytics, and AI and DS with Big Data, with a strong focus on applied statistics, artificial intelligence, predictive modelling, data mining, and forecasting methods. With an emphasis on industry projects, research, and consultancy, SDSF is equipped with expert faculty, advanced labs, and modern resources that prepare students to become data-driven professionals and business leaders.)
